---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Teaching"
  description="Machine Learning Tokyo sessions on implementing deep learning models from scratch."
>
  <div class="container">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Teaching</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Deep learning sessions</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">
        <a class="text-link" href="https://kshitijaggarwal.github.io/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Kshitij</a> and I ran code-focused sessions with
        <a class="text-link" href="https://machinelearningtokyo.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Machine Learning Tokyo</a>
        on selected chapters of <a class="text-link" href="https://d2l.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Dive into Deep Learning</a>.
        The sessions explored how to implement models from scratch; their materials remain available in the
        <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/Machine-Learning-Tokyo/d2l.ai" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">session repository</a>.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="content-block" aria-labelledby="sessions-heading">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="section-label">Session materials</p>
        <h2 id="sessions-heading">Topics and resources</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Teaching session resources" tabindex="0">
        <table class="teaching-table">
          <caption>Archived Machine Learning Tokyo sessions</caption>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">Session</th>
              <th scope="col">Chapter</th>
              <th scope="col">Slides</th>
              <th scope="col">Notebook</th>
              <th scope="col">Recording</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Setup &amp; MLP</th>
              <td><a href="https://d2l.ai/chapter_multilayer-perceptrons/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Multilayer perceptrons</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/13Tw_5Ib5Gu8qEC7VRCu26Hqzos-2ChQiDXI15N2jfK4/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Slides</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1c2z3w53sj4CvGe4Jouuj8FdmRsSn682G?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Notebook</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bs9EXRNmnK4" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Watch session</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">CNNs</th>
              <td><a href="https://d2l.ai/chapter_convolutional-neural-networks/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Convolutional neural networks</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1LFpKk8Y8-nF8cm6qq6rpt4XPg9Hy-OT0TOFgq0assNA/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Slides</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1Nt-TV7SxJ2_t1_FekdAhIXOesze1wcXt?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Notebook</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9-AhDYsx1CA" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Watch session</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">RNNs</th>
              <td><a href="https://d2l.ai/chapter_recurrent-neural-networks/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Recurrent neural networks</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1lxCz3TUyMnQgsPQtZozgylsBULFHREPs89IkU6a1mMc/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Slides</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1-G9YOMZ6stJwO-UxgYtz_44mf1J9wvG1?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Notebook</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mGPv5919KiQ" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Watch session</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Attention mechanisms 1</th>
              <td><a href="https://d2l.ai/chapter_attention-mechanisms-and-transformers/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Attention mechanisms</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1BLrhdWkwtchhCKpJas22nP91oNQAuwiXO7JXJyLH3pM/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Slides</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1PMR2pbXa3zjefLMiJc-j-8Cw2bAEwyva?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Notebook</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=baEQGk-CTwk" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Watch session</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Attention mechanisms 2</th>
              <td><a href="https://d2l.ai/chapter_attention-mechanisms-and-transformers/transformer.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Transformers</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1XZksYxKTNklKqLf84bmaVOBZrHt-5xP_tcm36UUQ338/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Slides</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1121V9HGWlXsBBMhKN-N6b0HlPD-0ujBR?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Notebook</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rRQcS1O58xk" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Watch session</a></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">GANs</th>
              <td><a href="https://d2l.ai/chapter_generative-adversarial-networks/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Generative adversarial networks</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1MS6kcZknuinF0R_Vsx_WcHq-f9rz7m150CRLADYZoWU/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Slides</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1Ws4ucFPs3bLbXy72GkDu0_RyzyOuc2cz?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Notebook</a></td>
              <td><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o76t3aW4IEo" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Watch session</a></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
